## SQ-MRD-01 | More Delight knives in the gear dump (queue group B: no terrain needed)
@group B
@commands `/dumpgear` knives; survival: mine a cobweb and a hay bale with each knife, `/data get entity @s SelectedItem` for damage
@pass Wooden Knife 1.5 / 2.0, mining speed 2, level 0; Stone Knife 2.5 / 2.0, speed 4, level 1 (the dump's speed column is the tier speed, now set with the dig speed); the stone knife cuts visibly faster than the wooden one and slower than a flint knife on hay
@fails speed 8 still: `tuneTools` set only the item's dig speed, not the tier copy (`tune_tools.js` applySpec `t.setSpeed`)
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> dumpgear
waitlog \[dumpgear\] \d+ armor pieces 300
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py gear moredelight:wooden_knife attackDamage=1.5 attackSpeed=2 miningSpeed=2 harvestLevel=0 moredelight:stone_knife attackDamage=2.5 attackSpeed=2 miningSpeed=4 harvestLevel=1

